{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A compilation from developer Sam Mortimer, combining arcade chaos, perplexing platformers, and cosmic adventures. Each game offers its own unique appeal!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Games</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the Tower \u2013 Time-trial platformer hand-drawn in ballpoint pen. How high can you climb?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in the Hole \u2013 \u201cFinite endless runner\u201d where amateur astronauts tumble into a black hole.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eggs \u2013 Frantic arcade score-chaser featuring a daring farm robbery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre \u2013 Sam\u2019s first game: an utterly bare-bones platformer with scrappy charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 \u2013 The follow-up platformer, bigger, bolder, and sweetly narrated by Dillon Bradbury.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mediocre 2 debuts exclusively in this collection. Eggs, Climb the Tower, Mediocre, and Get in the Hole have all been remastered from their mid-2010s editions with refined controls, updated UI, bug fixes, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"EGGS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905850/b8a6848e85bad63c553983cb232ac03d04bdbe44.jpg"},{"name":"CLIMB THE TOWER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905850/521bd2d0a9ea8419d6c5be4a983c6199b527292a.jpg"},{"name":"MEDIOCRE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905850/e5e3969b15647080f186c103df63d398e6e20cfd.jpg"},{"name":"GET IN THE HOLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905850/d09544c40796b40c14978131ae4b8f47be4e2721.jpg"},{"name":"MEDIOCRE 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3905850/d656eb3bbd71f27895232f7c12fc10ed